<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 9,400 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 4,800 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  153   (141 and 150)</p>
<p>    Good		145   (139 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     135   (132 and 122)</p>
<p>    Medium	    128   (126 and 100)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	100   (100 and  82)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 153 pence for a Burundi PD</p>
</text>
